    <!-- Downgrade Warnings -->
    <string name="downgrade_warning_debug_desc">You are about to install a lower version (v%1$s, code %2$d) over the current one (v%3$s, code %4$d).\n\nSince this is a Debuggable application, Android allows forcing the installation while keeping data using the -d flag.\n\nDo you wish to continue?</string>
    <string name="downgrade_blocked_release_desc">You are attempting to install an older version (v%1$s, code %2$d) over a newer version (v%3$s, code %4$d).\n\n⚠️ For security reasons, the Android OS strictly forbids downgrading Production (Release) apps without uninstalling them first.\n\nTo install this older version, you must manually uninstall the current version from your launcher or system settings (note that app data will be lost).</string>

